{
  // shadcn-svelte-mcp — fallow configuration
  // Research-backed choices to avoid false positives in this codebase:
  //  1. legacy-mastra/** is the old Mastra implementation, superseded by src/
  //     (migration in progress: tools were copied to src/mcp/tools/). Its deps
  //     (@mastra/*) aren't even in package.json anymore, so without this ignore
  //     fallow reports 15 unused files + ~7 unlisted deps that are pure noise.
  //  2. .mastra/** and .wrangler/** are build artifacts / stale output dirs.
  //  3. conventional-changelog-conventionalcommits is consumed implicitly as the
  //     semantic-release preset in .releaserc.json ({"preset":"conventionalcommits"})
  //     — fallow cannot see JSON-config presets, so it's a verified false positive.
  //  4. ignoreExportsUsedInFile mirrors knip: exports referenced within their own
  //     file (common in tool registration files) aren't flagged as unused.
  //  5. src/stdio.ts is the MCP stdio entry (package.json "mcp" script +
  //     "build" script) — declared explicitly so it's an entry even before the
  //     file lands during the migration.
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fallow-rs/fallow/main/schema.json",
  "entry": ["src/stdio.ts"],
  "ignorePatterns": [
    "legacy-mastra/**",
    ".mastra/**",
    ".wrangler/**",
    ".fallow/**"
  ],
  "ignoreDependencies": ["conventional-changelog-conventionalcommits"],
  "ignoreExportsUsedInFile": true
}
